<body>
<div style="text-align:center;margin:24px 0"><img src="../_svg/fraction_model.svg" alt="" style="max-width:95%;height:auto;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1)"></div>

<div class="lf-page">
<div class="lf-cover">
<div class="lf-cover-logo">LF Academy · LF Academy</div>
<div class="lf-cover-grade">小四 · 第 21 堂 · Student Edition Handout</div>
<div class="lf-cover-title">Fraction進階</div>
<div class="lf-cover-subtitle">真Fraction · 假Fraction · 帶Fraction互換 · 擴分約分 · 65 min</div>
<div class="lf-cover-info">
<b>Textbook Reference：</b>《小學數學新思維（第二版）》4下B冊 單元一<br/>
<b>核心Trap：</b>🪤 假Fraction變帶Fraction除錯方向 · 擴分約分漏做分子分母同步<br/>
<b>SSPA 關聯：</b><span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 高頻</span> Fraction基礎，呈分試計算+Word Problems必備<br/>
<b>Prerequisites：</b>P3 Fraction基本概念（分子·分母·幾分之幾）<br/>
<b>Lesson Objectives：</b>❶ 分辨真Fraction、假Fraction、帶Fraction ❷ 假Fraction↔帶Fraction互換 ❸ 擴分與約分 ❹ Fraction大小基本判斷
  </div>
<div class="lf-cover-row">
<span>Student Name：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>Class：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>Date：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>Duration：<span class="lf-line"></span></span>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">一、Warm-Up （5 min）（共 5 題，5 min）</div>

<div class="lf-game"><div class="lf-game-title">🍕 分數大作戰</div><div class="lf-game-desc">通分、約分、四則混合！避開分母陷阱。連續答對分數翻倍！</div><div class="lf-game-action">⚡ 開始挑戰 →</div></div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">1</td><td>一個蛋糕分成 8 等份，吃了 3 份。吃了蛋糕的幾分之幾？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">2</td><td><span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">3</span><span class="fn">8</span></span></span> 同 <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">5</span><span class="fn">8</span></span></span> 邊個大？點解？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">3</td><td>寫出下面圖形陰影部分的Fraction：<br/><svg height="70" viewbox="0 0 160 70" width="160"><rect fill="#DBEAFE" height="50" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2" width="28" x="10" y="10"></rect><rect fill="#DBEAFE" height="50" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2" width="28" x="38" y="10"></rect><rect fill="#1A3C6D" height="50" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2" width="28" x="66" y="10"></rect><rect fill="#DBEAFE" height="50" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2" width="28" x="94" y="10"></rect><rect fill="#1A3C6D" height="50" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2" width="28" x="122" y="10"></rect></svg></td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">4</td><td>2 個 <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">1</span><span class="fn">4</span></span></span> 等於幾多？寫成Fraction。</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">5</td><td>1 個完整嘅Circle形等於幾多個 <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">1</span><span class="fn">4</span></span></span>？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">二、Core Knowledge （15 min） ＋ Worked Examples</div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點一：真Fraction vs 假Fraction vs 帶Fraction <span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 SSPA</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
      ① <b>真Fraction：</b>分子 &lt; 分母。例：<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">3</span><span class="fn">8</span></span></span> 數值 &lt; 1（唔夠一個完整）<br/>
      ② <b>假Fraction：</b>分子 &gt;= 分母。例：<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">8</span><span class="fn">5</span></span></span> 數值 &gt;= 1（等於或超過一個完整）<br/>
      ③ <b>帶Fraction：</b>整數 + 真Fraction。例：1<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">3</span><span class="fn">5</span></span></span> = 1 個完整 + <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">3</span><span class="fn">5</span></span></span><br/>
      ④ 三者係同一數量嘅<b>不同寫法</b>！<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">8</span><span class="fn">5</span></span></span> = 1<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">3</span><span class="fn">5</span></span></span>
</div>
</div>
<div style="text-align:center;margin:8px 0;">
<svg height="155" viewbox="0 0 500 155" width="500">
<text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="13" font-weight="900" text-anchor="middle" x="250" y="20">三種Fraction寫法 — 同一個數量！</text>
<!-- 真Fraction: 3/5 -->
<rect fill="#DBEAFE" height="100" rx="6" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2" width="140" x="10" y="35"></rect>
<rect fill="#1A3C6D" height="55" width="26" x="22" y="47"></rect><rect fill="#1A3C6D" height="55" width="26" x="50" y="47"></rect><rect fill="#1A3C6D" height="55" width="26" x="78" y="47"></rect>
<rect fill="#FFF" height="55" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="1" width="26" x="106" y="47"></rect><rect fill="#FFF" height="55" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="1" width="26" x="134" y="47"></rect>
<text fill="#2563EB" font-size="12" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="85" y="120">真Fraction 3/5</text>
<!-- 假Fraction: 8/5 -->
<rect fill="#DCFCE7" height="100" rx="6" stroke="#16A34A" stroke-width="2" width="140" x="175" y="35"></rect>
<circle cx="210" cy="70" fill="#16A34A" r="22"></circle><circle cx="258" cy="70" fill="#16A34A" r="22"></circle>
<circle cx="210" cy="115" fill="#16A34A" r="22"></circle><circle cx="258" cy="115" fill="#16A34A" r="22"></circle>
<circle cx="306" cy="70" fill="#16A34A" r="22"></circle><circle cx="306" cy="115" fill="#16A34A" r="22"></circle>
<circle cx="210" cy="70" fill="none" r="22" stroke="#16A34A" stroke-width="1.5"></circle><circle cx="210" cy="70" fill="none" r="22" stroke="#16A34A" stroke-width="1.5"></circle>
<text fill="#16A34A" font-size="12" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="245" y="150">假Fraction 8/5</text>
<!-- 帶Fraction: 1 3/5 -->
<rect fill="#FEF3C7" height="100" rx="6" stroke="#C9A84C" stroke-width="2" width="140" x="345" y="35"></rect>
<circle cx="380" cy="65" fill="#C9A84C" r="22"></circle><circle cx="428" cy="65" fill="#C9A84C" r="22"></circle>
<circle cx="380" cy="110" fill="#C9A84C" r="22"></circle><circle cx="428" cy="110" fill="#C9A84C" r="22"></circle>
<circle cx="476" cy="65" fill="#C9A84C" r="22"></circle>
<rect fill="#FFF" height="35" rx="4" stroke="#C9A84C" stroke-width="1.5" width="60" x="375" y="48"></rect><text fill="#C9A84C" font-size="14" font-weight="900" text-anchor="middle" x="405" y="72">×1</text>
<rect fill="#C9A84C" height="55" width="26" x="22" y="47"></rect><rect fill="#C9A84C" height="55" width="26" x="50" y="47"></rect><rect fill="#C9A84C" height="55" width="26" x="78" y="47"></rect>
<rect fill="#FFF" height="55" stroke="#C9A84C" stroke-width="1" width="26" x="106" y="47"></rect><rect fill="#FFF" height="55" stroke="#C9A84C" stroke-width="1" width="26" x="134" y="47"></rect>
<text fill="#C9A84C" font-size="12" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="415" y="150">帶Fraction 1⅗</text>
</svg>
</div>
<div class="warn">⚠️ 致命Trap：假Fraction唔係「錯」嘅Fraction！分子大過分母係合法嘅寫法。8/5 = 一個完整蛋糕再加半個多啲！</div>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點二：假Fraction ↔ 帶Fraction互換 <span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 SSPA 必考</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
      ① <b>假Fraction → 帶Fraction：</b>分子 ÷ 分母 → 商 = 整數部分，餘數 = 新分子，分母不變<br/>
        例：<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">11</span><span class="fn">4</span></span></span> → 11 ÷ 4 = 2 餘 3 → 2<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">3</span><span class="fn">4</span></span></span><br/>
      ② <b>帶Fraction → 假Fraction：</b>整數 × 分母 + 分子 → 新分子，分母不變<br/>
        例：2<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">3</span><span class="fn">4</span></span></span> → 2 × 4 + 3 = 11 → <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">11</span><span class="fn">4</span></span></span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例1</div><div class="lf-ex-q">將 <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">7</span><span class="fn">3</span></span></span> 化為帶Fraction。</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例2</div><div class="lf-ex-q">將 3<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">2</span><span class="fn">5</span></span></span> 化為假Fraction。</div></div>
<div class="warn">⚠️ Common Mistake：7/3 → 除錯方向寫成 3/7！記住：<b>分子 ÷ 分母</b>（大除細），唔係細除大！</div>
<div class="lf-kp" style="margin-top:12px;">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點三：擴分與約分 <span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 SSPA</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
      ① <b>擴分：</b>分子和分母<b>同時乘同一個數</b>，數值不變<br/>
        例：<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">1</span><span class="fn">2</span></span></span> = <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">1×4</span><span class="fn">2×4</span></span></span> = <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">4</span><span class="fn">8</span></span></span><br/>
      ② <b>約分：</b>分子和分母<b>同時除同一個數</b>，數值不變。約到最簡 = 分子分母再无公Factor<br/>
        例：<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">8</span><span class="fn">12</span></span></span> ÷4÷4 → <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">2</span><span class="fn">3</span></span></span><br/>
      ③ 擴分約分 = <b>Fraction的變身術</b>！值一樣，樣唔同！
    </div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例3</div><div class="lf-ex-q">將 <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">3</span><span class="fn">4</span></span></span> 擴分，使分母變成 12。</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例4</div><div class="lf-ex-q">將 <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">6</span><span class="fn">9</span></span></span> 約至最簡Fraction。</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex-compare">
<div class="lf-ex-wrong"><div class="lf-ex-label">❌ Common Mistake</div><div class="eq">擴分只乘分母唔乘分子<br/>1/2 → 4/2（錯！值變咗）</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex-right"><div class="lf-ex-label">✅ Correct Approach</div><div class="eq">分子分母同步乘/除<br/>1/2 → 4/8（對！值不變）</div></div>
</div>
<div class="lf-game">
<div class="gtitle">🎮 遊戲：Fraction變身王</div>
<div class="grule">老師出一個Fraction，學生鬥快講出兩個擴分同兩個約分！例：2/3 → 4/6、6/9（擴）；6/9 → 2/3（約）</div>
</div>
<div class="lf-h2">知識點一至三 同步練習</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">6</td><td>分辨以下Fraction：<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">5</span><span class="fn">8</span></span></span>（____Fraction）· <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">9</span><span class="fn">4</span></span></span>（____Fraction）· 2<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">1</span><span class="fn">3</span></span></span>（____Fraction）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">7</td><td>假Fraction轉帶Fraction：<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">13</span><span class="fn">5</span></span></span> = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">8</td><td>帶Fraction轉假Fraction：3<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">2</span><span class="fn">7</span></span></span> = ？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">三、Tiered Practice （20 min）</div>
<div class="lf-h2">🌱 Foundation Tier（All Must Complete，共 3 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">9</td><td>指出以下是真Fraction(T)、假Fraction(F)定帶Fraction(M)：<br/>(a) <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">7</span><span class="fn">10</span></span></span> (b) <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">5</span><span class="fn">5</span></span></span> (c) 1<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">2</span><span class="fn">9</span></span></span> (d) <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">12</span><span class="fn">7</span></span></span></td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:80px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">10</td><td>假Fraction轉帶Fraction：<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">17</span><span class="fn">6</span></span></span> = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:80px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">11</td><td>帶Fraction轉假Fraction：4<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">1</span><span class="fn">3</span></span></span> = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:80px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h2">🌿 Intermediate Tier（🚶🚀 Optional，共 3 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">12</td><td>將 <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">3</span><span class="fn">8</span></span></span> 擴分成分母為 24 的Fraction，再將結果約至最簡。</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:80px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">13</td><td>將 <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">18</span><span class="fn">24</span></span></span> 約至最簡Fraction。再用兩個不同嘅擴分寫出等值Fraction。</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:85px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">14</td><td>比較：<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">5</span><span class="fn">8</span></span></span> ___ <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">7</span><span class="fn">8</span></span></span>（填 ＞、＜ 或 ＝） 點解？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:80px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h2">🌳 Challenge Tier（🚀 Optional，共 3 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">15</td><td>一個Fraction約分後係 <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">3</span><span class="fn">5</span></span></span>，原Fraction嘅分子係 15。原Fraction = ？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:80px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">16</td><td>以下邊啲Fraction係等值？<br/>A.<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">2</span><span class="fn">3</span></span></span> B.<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">4</span><span class="fn">6</span></span></span> C.<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">8</span><span class="fn">12</span></span></span> D.<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">3</span><span class="fn">5</span></span></span> E.<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">10</span><span class="fn">15</span></span></span></td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:85px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">17</td><td>小明有 <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">16</span><span class="fn">3</span></span></span> 個薄餅，轉成帶Fraction後有幾多個完整薄餅同剩幾分之幾？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:80px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h2">🏔️ 終極挑戰（🚀 Optional，共 1 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">18</td><td>一個Fraction約分後係 <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">2</span><span class="fn">3</span></span></span>，如果將原Fraction嘅分子加 6，分母加 9，約分後仍係 <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">2</span><span class="fn">3</span></span></span>。原Fraction可能係咩？寫出三個可能。</td><td class="qd d4">🏔️</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:65px;"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">四、Word Problems （12 min）（SSPA 文字題，共 5 題）</div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例5</div><div class="lf-ex-q">一條彩帶長 <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">15</span><span class="fn">4</span></span></span> 米，寫成帶Fraction。如果用了 2<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">1</span><span class="fn">4</span></span></span> 米，剩下幾多米？（用假Fraction作答）</div></div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">19</td><td>媽媽切咗一個蛋糕成 12 等份。弟弟食咗 5 份，妹妹食咗 7 份。分別用Fraction寫出佢哋食咗幾多個蛋糕。邊個食得多？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:85px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">20</td><td>一盒果汁有 3 升。倒咗 <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">7</span><span class="fn">3</span></span></span> 升出嚟，即係幾多升？（用帶Fraction作答）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:80px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">21</td><td>小明跑步用咗 2<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">3</span><span class="fn">4</span></span></span> 圈，小華用咗 <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">11</span><span class="fn">4</span></span></span> 圈。邊個跑得多？多幾圈？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:85px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">22</td><td>將 <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">3</span><span class="fn">5</span></span></span> 同 <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">9</span><span class="fn">15</span></span></span> 比較。用約分解釋佢哋係咪等值。</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:85px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">23</td><td>老師有 <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">23</span><span class="fn">5</span></span></span> 打鉛筆，即係幾打零幾支？（1打=12支，用帶Fraction答）</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:88px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">五、Homework （課後完成）</div>
<div class="lf-h2">Foundation (Required)（共 5 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H1</td><td>分辨類型：<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">4</span><span class="fn">9</span></span></span> · <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">8</span><span class="fn">3</span></span></span> · 3<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">2</span><span class="fn">5</span></span></span> · <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">12</span><span class="fn">12</span></span></span></td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H2</td><td>假Fraction轉帶Fraction：<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">19</span><span class="fn">6</span></span></span> = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H3</td><td>帶Fraction轉假Fraction：2<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">5</span><span class="fn">8</span></span></span> = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H4</td><td>擴分：<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">2</span><span class="fn">5</span></span></span> = <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">?</span><span class="fn">20</span></span></span></td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H5</td><td>約分至最簡：<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">12</span><span class="fn">18</span></span></span> = ？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h2">Advanced (Optional)（共 3 題，🚀 Optional）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H6</td><td>將 <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">15</span><span class="fn">20</span></span></span> 約至最簡，再將最簡Fraction擴分成兩個不同分母的等值Fraction。</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:85px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H7</td><td>一個假Fraction化為帶Fraction後係 3<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">5</span><span class="fn">8</span></span></span>，求原來的假Fraction。</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:80px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H8</td><td>爸爸車程用咗 2<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">3</span><span class="fn">4</span></span></span> 小時，即係幾多個<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">1</span><span class="fn">4</span></span></span>小時？（用假Fraction答）</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:80px;"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">六、Common Error Summary （8 min）</div>
<div style="margin:14px 0;padding:10px 14px;background:#F0FDF4;border:1.5px solid #BBF7D0;border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;">
<strong style="color:#166534;">✅ Self Check（完成後打剔）</strong>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:6px;">
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 我識得分辦每個知識點嘅Trap</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 我能夠獨立完成🌱基礎題</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 我能夠挑戰🌿進階題</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 我記得住Mnemonic</span>
</div>
</div>
<div style="margin:12px 0;padding:10px 14px;background:#FFFBEB;border:1.5px solid var(--gold);border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;">
<strong style="color:#92400E;">🎯 Learning Objectives Review — 完成本堂後你應該能夠：</strong>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-top:6px;">
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 辨認本堂所有Trap類型</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 獨立解答🌱基礎題（100%正確）</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 挑戰🌿進階題（80%+正確）</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 向同學解釋本堂Mnemonic</span>
</div>
</div>
<table class="et">
<tr><th>#</th><th>Common Error（❌ Trap）</th><th>Correct Approach（✅）</th></tr>
<tr><td>1</td><td><b>假Fraction當錯誤</b>：分子&gt;分母就以為計錯</td><td>假Fraction係合法寫法！8/5 = 一個完整+3/5</td></tr>
<tr><td>2</td><td><b>假→帶除錯方向</b>：7/3 用 3÷7</td><td>分子÷分母（大除細）：7÷3=2餘1 → 2又1/3</td></tr>
<tr><td>3</td><td><b>帶→假計錯</b>：2⅗ → 2+3+5=10（❌）</td><td>2×5+3=13 → 13/5（整數×分母+分子）</td></tr>
<tr><td>4</td><td><b>擴分只乘分母</b>：1/2 → 3/2（❌ 值變咗）</td><td>分子分母同步乘：1/2 → 3/6（✅）</td></tr>
<tr><td>5</td><td><b>約分只除分子</b>：8/12 → 4/12（❌）</td><td>分子分母同步除：8/12 → 2/3（✅）</td></tr>
<tr><td>6</td><td><b>沒有約到最簡就停</b>：12/18=6/9（未最簡！）</td><td>仲可以除3：6/9=2/3（最簡！）</td></tr>
<tr><td>7</td><td><b>帶Fraction比較只睇Fraction部分</b>：1⅞ vs 2¼</td><td>先睇整數部分！2 &gt; 1 → 2¼ 一定大啲</td></tr>
</table>
<div class="mn">🧠 Mnemonic：「分子除分母得商同餘數，商係整餘係子母照舊。擴分約分同步走，分子分母一齊郁，Fraction數值未曾變。」</div>
<div class="mn" style="margin-top:4px;">🧠 速記：「真小於一，假大於等於一，帶分整數加Fraction。分子大過分母變帶分，整數乘分母加分子變假分。」</div>
<div class="lf-h1">七、4-Step Problem Solving</div>
<div class="sc">
<div class="sc-card"><div class="snum">1</div><div class="stitle">睇類型</div><div class="sdetail">分子&lt;分母→真Fraction。分子&gt;=分母→假Fraction。有整數+Fraction→帶Fraction</div></div>
<div class="sc-card"><div class="snum">2</div><div class="stitle">假→帶</div><div class="sdetail">分子÷分母。商=整數，餘數=新分子，分母照舊</div></div>
<div class="sc-card"><div class="snum">3</div><div class="stitle">帶→假</div><div class="sdetail">整數×分母+分子=新分子，分母照舊。記住：先乘後加！</div></div>
<div class="sc-card"><div class="snum">4</div><div class="stitle">擴/約</div><div class="sdetail">分子分母同步乘（擴分）或除（約分）。數值永遠不變！</div></div>
</div>
